    "sections": {
        "description": "Strakture is a modern Full Site Editing (FSE) base theme built for flexibility and speed. It pairs perfectly with the Strakture AI pattern library plugin, giving you access to a growing collection of professionally designed patterns to build any type of website. With WooCommerce support baked in, Strakture is ready for everything from portfolios to full-scale online stores. ★ Demo: https://strakture.com/main ★"
